# Claude Code writes machine-local permissions here. A shared .claude/settings.json
# is legitimate and stays tracked; only the local override is personal state.
.claude/settings.local.json

# There is no npm in this portfolio by house rule, but Playwright has clearly
# been run here at some point (see the three rules above) and it does not arrive
# alone. Insurance against a 200MB accident.
node_modules/

# macOS AppleDouble sidecars, created when copying to non-native filesystems.
._*
